{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_st02",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_st02",
  "title": "鳶尾花",
  "storyCode": "GA-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1458aac580edf825c2c4a66f262a85dc84fe776aae09b0ef287832db601a590d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "我都要把這次來拉特蘭當成一次度假了......沒想到會發生這樣的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "尤卡坦，謝拉格也是有信仰的小國......為什麼拉特蘭可以這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "拉特蘭的影響力實在廣泛得多......萬國信使也是拉特蘭教宗佈局已久的安排。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "謝拉格沒有這樣的基礎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "哈......影響力，影響力，走出謝拉格才發現，影響力真是個麻煩的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "現在想想，也真虧恩希歐迪斯過去只靠自己在幾個鄰國間周旋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "如今，聖女大人的影響力也在逐步提升......我們有我們的優勢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "嗯......可你覺得，拉特蘭教宗說的那些，真能實現嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "......我不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "我無法想像，各個國家保持更加緊密的聯繫，這片大地會是什麼樣子......這聽起來像一個夢。也不知道是不是好夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "但是那天的神跡......還有教宗的演講，沒有人能等閒視之。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "拉特蘭，果真是被眷顧之城......嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "艾澤爾小哥，你們薩科塔怎麼看這段時間的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "嗯？啊......是，很大的衝擊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "我想也是，聽人說那口鐘幾千年沒響過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "拉特蘭會怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......也許不會怎麼樣，以我對拉特蘭人的瞭解......不，也許哪裡都是一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "即使發生了後世歷史中舉足輕重的大事......在當時當地，大家也許，都沒什麼實感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "但我們總會意識到變化正在發生，承擔起屬於自己的責任與使命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "......你還蠻有擔當的嘛，小哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "好了，就送到這裡吧，接我們的車會開到這裡來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "辛苦你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "沒事。薇爾麗芙樞機就在附近的醫院，我直接去向她覆命，很方便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "啊，說到那位樞機，替我向她道謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "“您滿意就好”——樞機是這麼吩咐的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "真是滴水不漏......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "對了，小哥，幫我和我丈夫拍張照吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "這樣就可以了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "休露絲",
      "text": "攝影技術也不錯，艾澤爾小哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤卡坦",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "兩位不客氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "菲亞梅塔，你有沒有覺得自己的腳步特別沉重？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "教宗閣下講了那樣的話，你難道沒有感受到肩上的重擔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "所以？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "所以我在認真考慮是不是該換一份工作了，太需要責任感的工作不太適合我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我看你接替我就很合適。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "做夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "兩位，下午好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "艾澤爾小哥，好久不見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "也就不到兩周啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你......在執行任務？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "薇爾麗芙樞機安排了一點事情，我正要去向她覆命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "這是我在拉特蘭城的最後一項任務了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "不錯嘛，小哥，出去看過了就知道，拉特蘭城蠻無聊的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "雖然外面沒有那麼多好吃的甜點，不過，我們生活的意義也不只是享受，對吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你要去找薇爾麗芙？她現在在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "司提望區中心醫院。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "走吧，艾澤爾小哥，我們同路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "你決定了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "嗯，我決定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我以為你還要猶豫一段時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "沒什麼......只是覺得，大家都邁出了下一步，我也不能再原地踏步了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "那我就不多問了。你能答應，我已經很高興了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "現在這種時候，有你這樣的人才加入，再好不過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "就猜到你會在這裡，薇爾麗芙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "你們怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我們半路遇到了艾澤爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "謝拉格的兩位使者已經送達目的地了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "辛苦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "別急著走，我來這裡還有別的事，你跟我一起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "那麼，蕾繆安，下周見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "下周見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "決定去七廳了嗎，蕾繆安？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "已經在做事了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......會議之後，去七廳會很辛苦吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "不覺得七廳很適合我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "是倒是啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "你們都走上了自己的路，我也該想想我能做的事啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我剛才還在和菲亞梅塔說，想辭了萬國信使的工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "怕麻煩了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "那老傢伙......我已經看到麻煩越來越多的未來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "跑不掉的哦，莫斯提馬。你要歸我直管了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "先幫我個小忙，把這封信帶去給小樂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......能拒絕嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "而且你必須親手交給她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "更想辭職了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "別說敷衍自己的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "好嚴格啊，菲亞梅塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你不會放棄的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "這麼肯定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "別裝得像你不需要這份工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你也在找答案，不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我可不是安多恩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "沒說你是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "但你還要選，對嗎，關於你到底是誰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "要回答這樣的問題......每個人都得走過足夠長的路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "哎呀，莫斯提馬，被理解的感覺怎麼樣？看來不需要光環也能理解你哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......那這就是我自己的路。你不該跟著我，菲亞梅塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "少自大了，誰跟著你？只是恰好同路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "他的銃在我手上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "如果他真的還認為自己是一個薩科塔，他會來取回這把銃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "到了那個時候，我會讓他為自己做的事付出代價......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你要做我的幫手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "說到這個，之前在城裡抓到的迷途者，已經全部釋放了哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......是教宗閣下的意思嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "嗯哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "教宗閣下的仁慈和我沒關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "......真是菲亞梅塔的風格啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "另外，之後會讓你走五廳的流程，用公證所的協定掛靠到羅德島。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "呃，莫斯提馬和蕾繆樂兼職的那家醫藥公司......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "薇爾麗芙希望和那家公司加深合作，你作為人選就很合適啊~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "而且，就我所知，我們和那家公司的合作記錄相當不錯，應該能給你提供不少支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "然後然後，菲亞梅塔，還有一個超級好消息要告訴你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "現在，你竟然可以從三~個代號裡！選一個，成為你下次的任務代號哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......說實在的，既然現在是你和我們對接，這個規則真的不能取消嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "只是因為當時沒有明確的監視這傢伙的職位，才臨時起了個名字......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "我已經受夠每個月都會變一次的職位名了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "微光守夜人你不是挺喜歡的嗎，還說上面的品味總算變好了一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你給我閉嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "啊，這朵花真好看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "話是這樣說......可事到如今，你職位名字的變化也已經成了一種規則了，就認命吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "text": "“虛空美食家”，“曠野飛行員”，“黎明破壞者”，選一個。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......“黎明破壞者”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "說真的，菲亞梅塔，你的品味挺好懂的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你給我閉嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "嘶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "......感覺我最近真的很倒楣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "怎麼，嫌躺著不舒服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "不會，當我沒說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "嗯？艾澤爾小哥也在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我讓他來看看，差點背叛拉特蘭的人會有什麼下場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "這麼敲打年輕人也太過分了，薇爾麗芙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我也是年輕人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "對不起。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "你不再是萬國信使了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "如果這就是代價......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "但你仍然是我的部下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "那這代價還不小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "你向我誇下了海口，奧倫。那就讓我看看，你在維多利亞都學到了什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "......我是否可以認為，你需要我以我的方式行事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "現在，我可以回答你之前那個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "奧倫，我對於成為一個高尚的人沒有興趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "但我並不討厭為了高尚的人而付出努力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "這......我倒也不反對。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "這些話也是說給我聽的嗎，樞機？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "珍惜你和塞茜莉亞得到的機會。別讓我知道，她會對拉特蘭......有什麼影響。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "您......不希望塞茜莉亞再回到拉特蘭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "如果我那麼希望，為什麼要花時間給那個孩子造一個戶籍呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "除了，啊，同情。更重要的當然是......她還有別樣的價值，我願意為這種價值而承擔風險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "相信我，小哥，獲得這種坦率的承諾對你只有好處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "不用緊張。我只是在向你展現屬於拉特蘭的誠意，僅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "若你和塞茜莉亞何時厭倦了旅行......你們還可以回到拉特蘭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "拉特蘭會給你們留一扇門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "請進。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "費德里科前輩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "樞機薇爾麗芙，這是前萬國信使奧倫·亞吉奧拉斯近兩年的出行記錄報告。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "辛苦你了，執行者費德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "以防萬一。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "根據已有情報，推測執行者里凱萊可能是他的共犯，需要傳訊里凱萊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "不用。他一定會說自己“被老同學蒙在鼓裡”，對吧，奧倫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "......可怕的女人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我不會追究里凱萊......暫時。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "不過，之後我希望透過你和他聊一聊，沒問題吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "沒有，完全沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "目前對此二人的處置就是這樣，執行者費德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "等等，費德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "我後來想到一件事。你從一本筆記的寥寥數語，要摸清那個和薩卡茲見面的女人是費莉亞，這不是件容易的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "為什麼那麼執著？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "你在找的究竟是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "......阿爾圖羅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅......嗯？阿爾圖羅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "就是那個通緝犯阿爾圖羅？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "......費德里科，你和阿爾圖羅是什麼關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "她是我的遠親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "......哈，哈哈哈哈哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "說實在的，費德里科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "如果不是我現在站都站不穩，我真的想拉你去喝個酒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "我沒有空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "你會有的。因為我恰好在幾年前......真的見到過那位比安多恩名氣還要大得多的通緝犯，阿爾圖羅小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "冷靜！冷靜！薇爾麗芙！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "我不是主動找上阿爾圖羅！只是正好碰上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "說真的，我自認算見多識廣，但那段經歷，即使是我也感到毛骨悚然......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "text": "你在哪裡見到她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧倫",
      "text": "三年前，在萊塔尼亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "里凱萊前輩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "各種手續都辦好了，她現在可以自由離開拉特蘭了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "謝謝你，里凱萊前輩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "應該的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "你知道自己接下來該去哪吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "嗯......我們先去和費德里科前輩會合，去一家叫做羅德島的公司掛靠一個合作協定。畢竟要在外面待很久......據說這樣會方便很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "嗯，你記得就好，招呼我已經打過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "你仍然是公證所的執行者。不方便回來的時候，任務也會透過羅德島發給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "我有預感，你和小塞茜莉亞的旅途會很順利，說不定很快就能找到要找的人哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "我的預感一向很準。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......謝謝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "那我就先走了，再見，小塞茜莉亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "再見，里凱萊哥哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "阿嚏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "text": "嘶......怎麼忽然有種要倒楣的預感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "里凱萊前輩也相當有個性啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "咦，等等，他怎麼知道我們在找......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥，怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "沒事，塞茜莉亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "還想......說點什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩鬆開了年輕薩科塔的手，走入花田中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "（我要離開拉特蘭了，媽媽。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "（但不是逃走。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "（我會自己去找爸爸，會把你的話帶給他。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "（我要用自己的眼睛看外面的世界......我要去找卡茲戴爾。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "（媽媽，我很幸福。過去、現在......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "（請看著我。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "修士姐姐，我可以摘一朵白色的花嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修士",
      "text": "可以的，小妹妹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "謝謝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞要帶走這朵花嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "鮮花可能保存不了太久......我幫你做成標本吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "嗯，請教教我，我也想學會自己做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "謝謝你，艾澤爾哥哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞，該說謝謝的是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "咦......那是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "帕蒂亞，你真的要和我一起走嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "其實我覺得，說不定你可以留在拉特蘭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "拉特蘭沒有我的目標。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "怎麼了，帕蒂亞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "......不，沒什麼，是我冒昧了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "只是......您......您是在笑嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "不，我不是說您平時......但好像，不太一樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "長久以來，我以為我們於荒野中踽踽獨行......這是我的不成熟和自以為是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "帕蒂亞，那天，你聽到那位老人的演講了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "......醒過來的時候，剛好聽到後面一半，全城的廣播都在放......很吵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "伊萬傑利斯塔，擁有犧牲與團結美德的聖徒......也許，他比之前使用這個名字的十人，走得更遠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "真是宏大又易碎的願景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "但我願奉上祝福......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕蒂亞",
      "text": "......那天，您到底知曉了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "不重要了，帕蒂亞，不那麼重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "即使道路的盡頭沒有獎賞，前行本身就是舉火。我亦當向前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "我們所做的一切，不為交易恩賜，不為換取垂憐，我們依仗自己堅信的事物行路，是因為......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "這是唯一有尊嚴的生活。不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅塞菈",
      "text": "先導，我們該出發了，得趕在太陽落山之前。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "text": "走吧，兄弟姐妹們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞，你在看什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "不，什麼都沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "落日真美呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
